Package: finalproject
Title: Data Quality and Health Patterns in US Public Health
Version: 0.0.3
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Zun",
           family = "Cao",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "zuncao@hsph.harvard.edu")
Description: This package explores public health patterns using
    NHANES and CDC disease outbreak data. It examines associations
    between sleep duration and blood pressure, as well as seasonal
    and regional patterns in waterborne disease outbreaks. It also
    considers data quality, missing values, and limitations.
Depends: R (>= 4.5.0)
